@schleicher_majority_coalition_prussia
title: Staal forms a majority government with only the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>.
subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> ([+ gnu_r_heartland +]%)
view-if: gnu_r_heartland >= 50 and chancellor == "Staal" and staal_time and gnu_formed
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">GNU</span> ([+ gnu_r_heartland +]%)
on-arrival: in_staal_majority_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Goodlake"; commons_gnu += 3; burgher_gnu += 3; guild_gnu += 3; landed_gnu += 3; disfavored_gnu += 3; faithful_gnu += 3; commons_collectivist -= 3; commons_marcher -= 3; vanguard_banned = 1; vanguard_strength -= 50; banner_strength -= 200; heartland_police_loyalty = 0; pro_republic -= 10

With a majority in Heartland as well, Staal tightens his grip behind a democratic façade. The Heartland police are reshaped further to serve his purposes, and the government now sets education policy. A new curriculum is imposed, centered on discipline, nationalism, and hostility to <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformism</span>.

@schleicher_left_coalition_prussia
title: Staal forms a majority with the left.
subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> + <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>[? if not unionist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and not dstp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] ([+ staal_left_coalition_heartland +]%)
view-if: staal_left_coalition_heartland >= 50 and chancellor == "Staal" and staal_time and gnu_formed
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">GNU</span> + <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span>[? if not unionist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">Arcanists</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and not dstp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] ([+ staal_left_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if not super_secret_mode: - Staal would never coalition with us outright. ?]
choose-if: president != "DuFour" and super_secret_mode
on-arrival: in_staal_left_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Goodlake"; commons_gnu += 3; burgher_gnu += 3; guild_gnu += 3; landed_gnu += 3; disfavored_gnu += 3; faithful_gnu += 3; commons_collectivist -= 3; commons_marcher -= 3; vanguard_banned = 1; vanguard_strength -= 50; banner_strength -= 200; heartland_police_loyalty = 0; pro_republic -= 10

Placeholder

@schleicher_right_coalition_prussia
title: Staal forms a majority with the right.
subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>[? if not unionist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and not dstp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and gold_exist and not gold_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if not other_gnu:&nbsp;+ **Others**?][? if kvp_formed and not kvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CPP**</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate":&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if dsu_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">**CSG**</span>?] ([+ staal_right_coalition_heartland +]%)
view-if: staal_right_coalition_heartland >= 50 and chancellor == "Staal" and staal_time and gnu_formed
choose-if: dsu_leader != "Corin Crowde"
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">GNU</span>[? if not unionist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">Arcanists</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and not dstp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and gold_exist and not gold_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?][? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?][? if not other_gnu:&nbsp;+ Others?][? if kvp_formed and not kvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">CPP</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate":&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span>?][? if dsu_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">CSG</span>?] ([+ staal_right_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if dsu_leader == "Corin Crowde": -The <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">CSG</span> have gone completely off the deep end. ?]
on-arrival: in_staal_right_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Goodlake" if heartland_leader != "Crowde"; heartland_leader = "Crowde" if heartland_leader != "Goodlake"; commons_collectivist -= 2; commons_marcher -= 2; vanguard_banned = 1; vanguard_strength -= 40; banner_strength -= 150; heartland_police_loyalty = 0; pro_republic -= 8

Staal's preferred coalition is one with the right, cooperating with the hard line <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">**CSG**</span> to enact sweeping reforms to the education and policing system reformed under our years of rule. 

[+ heartland_leader +] has been selected as Minister-President of Heartland.

@spd_majority
title: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> majority alone
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>: [+ marcher_r_heartland +]%
view-if: marcher_r_heartland >= 50
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5; army_loyalty -= 0.05 if chancellor == "Bristol"; ddp_right += 2; gold_right += 4; lvp_right += 3; liberal_cooperation += 5; bourgeois_cooperation += 5; heartland_leader = "Bristol"; in_marcher_majority_heartland = 1; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.1; heartland_police_strength += 50; democratization += 3; coup_progress += 1; capital_strike_progress += 2; ddp_relation -= 3; lvp_relation -= 3; unionist_relation -= 3; marcher_heartland = 1

Finally, the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> can govern alone! Our long campaign of electioneering has paid off. We do not need to worry about coalition government; anything is possible. However, our former coalition partners are going to start drifting to the right.

Bristol is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland.

@social_christian_coalition_prussia
title: Can we form a <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #000000;">Faithful</span> Coalition?
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> ([+ social_catholic_coalition_heartland +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> ([+ social_catholic_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if far_right_coalition_heartland >= 50: - The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> are able to form a government. ?] [? if not ((unionist_relation >= 70 and concord_ideology == "Moderate") or (unionist_relation >= 60 and concord_ideology == "Left")): - We do not have the adequate relations with the <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>. ?]
view-if: social_catholic_coalition_heartland >= 50 and concord_formed
choose-if: far_right_coalition_heartland < 50 and ((unionist_relation >= 70 and concord_ideology == "Moderate") or (unionist_relation >= 60 and concord_ideology == "Left"))
on-arrival: in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 1; was_in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick" if concord_leader != "Sedgewick"; heartland_leader = "Askew" if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"; pro_republic += 6; burgher_unionist += 4; burgher_marcher += 2; unionist_relation += 5; reformist_dissent -= 10; marcher_heartland = 1

We have secured enough votes to form a "<span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #000000;">Faithful</span> Coalition" government, bringing together the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and the <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>. Unexpectedly, thanks to our good relations and the relatively favorable leadership of the <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span>, we have successfully convinced them to join the coalition in Heartland—a region where the left wing of the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> has historically held significant influence.

[? if heartland_leader != "Bristol": [+ heartland_leader +] has been selected as Minister-President of Heartland.?]

@social_liberal_coalition_prussia
title: We can form a <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-[? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">Liberal</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">Liberal</span>?] Coalition.
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] ([+ social_liberal_coalition_heartland +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] ([+ social_liberal_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if far_right_coalition_heartland >= 50: - The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> are able to form a government. ?] [? if not ((ddp_relation >= 60 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 50 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 40 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed: - We do not have the adequate relations with the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>. ?] [? if not ((lvp_relation >= 70 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 60 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 50 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed: - We do not have adequate relations with the <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>. ?]
view-if: social_liberal_coalition_heartland >= 50 and concord_formed
choose-if: far_right_coalition_heartland < 50 and ((((ddp_relation >= 60 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 50 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 40 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed) or (((lvp_relation >= 70 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 60 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 50 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed))
on-arrival: in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland = 1; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland = 1; liberal_cooperation -= 1 if liberal_parliament == 1; heartland_leader = "Bristol"; pro_republic += 3; ddp_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; reformist_dissent -= 10; burgher_ddp += 2; burgher_lvp += 2; burgher_marcher += 2; marcher_heartland = 1

We have enough votes to form a "<span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-[? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">Liberal</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">Liberal</span>?] Coalition" government consisting of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and [? if ddp_name == "Gold" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Democratic**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "CSP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**State**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] [? if not lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>)?][? if lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?]! The formation of the right-wing <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> has made this a possibility. [? if liberal_parliament == 1: The liberal parliamentary group has come under strain to the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> acting on its own accord. ?] 

[? if heartland_leader != "Bristol": [+ heartland_leader +] is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland. ?]

@minority_social_christian_coalition_prussia
title: Can we form a minority <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #000000;">Faithful</span> Coalition?
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> ([+ social_catholic_coalition_heartland +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> ([+ social_catholic_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if far_right_coalition_heartland >= 50: - The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> are able to form a government. ?] [? if not ((unionist_relation >= 60 and concord_ideology == "Moderate") or (unionist_relation >= 50 and concord_ideology == "Left")): - We do not have the adequate relations with the <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>. ?]
view-if: social_catholic_coalition_heartland < 50 and was_in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland and concord_formed
choose-if: far_right_coalition_heartland < 50 and ((unionist_relation >= 60 and concord_ideology == "Moderate") or (unionist_relation >= 50 and concord_ideology == "Left"))
on-arrival: in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 1; in_minority_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 1; was_in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick" if concord_leader != "Sedgewick"; heartland_leader = "Askew" if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"; pro_republic += 4; burgher_unionist += 2; burgher_marcher += 2; unionist_relation += 3; reformist_dissent -= 10; marcher_heartland = 1

[? if social_catholic_coalition_heartland >= 45: We have enough votes to continue the "<span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #000000;">Faithful</span> Coalition" government between the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>. ?][? if social_catholic_coalition_heartland < 45: We are able to stay in control of Heartland maintaining the "<span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #000000;">Faithful</span> Coalition" government for the time being despite the lack of a majority. The recently instituted constructive vote of no confidence will allow our government to stay in power until another majority coalition agrees on a unified candidate for Minister-President, which is unlikely. ?]

[? if heartland_leader != "Bristol": [+ heartland_leader +] has been selected as Minister-President of Heartland.?]

@minority_social_liberal_coalition_prussia
title: We can form a minority <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-[? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">Liberal</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">Liberal</span>?] Coalition.
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] ([+ social_liberal_coalition_heartland +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] ([+ social_liberal_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if far_right_coalition_heartland >= 50: - The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> are able to form a government. ?] [? if not ((ddp_relation >= 50 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 40 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed: - We do not have the adequate relations with the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>. ?] [? if not ((lvp_relation >= 60 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 50 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 40 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed: - We do not have adequate relations with the <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>. ?]
view-if: social_liberal_coalition_heartland < 50 and was_in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland and concord_formed
choose-if: far_right_coalition_heartland < 50 and ((((ddp_relation >= 50 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 40 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed) or (((lvp_relation >= 60 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 50 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 40 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed))
