unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?][? if sapd_formed and collectivist_relation >= 30 :&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #9B0000;">Laborists</span> toleration?] ([+ weimar_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if far_right_coalition_heartland >= 50: - The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> are able to form a government. ?] [? if not ((unionist_relation >= 30 and unionist_ideology == "Right") or (unionist_relation >= 25 and unionist_leader == "Hawkins") or (unionist_relation >= 20 and unionist_leader == "Stilling")): - We do not have the adequate relations with the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?]. ?] [? if not (ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Right") and not (ddp_relation >= 25 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") and not (ddp_relation >= 20 and ddp_ideology == "Left") and not lvp_formed: - We do not have the adequate relations with the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>. ?] [? if not ((lvp_relation >= 40 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 35 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 30 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed: - We do not have adequate relations with the <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>. ?]
view-if: weimar_coalition_heartland < 50 and was_in_weimar_coalition_heartland == 1 and not concord_formed
choose-if: far_right_coalition_heartland < 50 and (((unionist_relation >= 30 and unionist_ideology == "Right") or (unionist_relation >= 25 and unionist_leader == "Hawkins") or (unionist_relation >= 20 and unionist_leader == "Stilling")) and ((((ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 25 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 20 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed) or (((lvp_relation >= 40 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 35 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 30 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed)))
on-arrival: in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 1; in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland = 1; was_in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Bristol"; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick" if (braun_resign and unionist_leader != "Sedgewick"); heartland_leader = "Askew" if (braun_resign and unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"); coup_progress += 1 if weimar_coalition_heartland < 45; lvp_right += 1; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; bourgeois_cooperation += 1; ddp_relation += 2; unionist_relation += 2; lvp_relation += 2; marcher_heartland = 1
go-to: prussia_minister_president if heartland_leader == "Bristol"

[? if weimar_coalition_heartland >= 45: We have enough votes to continue the "Unity Coalition" government consisting of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and [? if ddp_name == "Gold" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Democratic**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "CSP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**State**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] [? if not lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>)?][? if lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?] parties! This has been the ruling coalition since 4284. ?][? if weimar_coalition_heartland < 45: We are able to stay in control of Heartland maintaining the "Unity Coalition" government for the time being despite the lack of a majority. This has been the ruling coalition since 4284. ?]

[? if weimar_coalition_heartland >= 45: Although we lack a simple majority in the state Assembly, we remain in power thanks to the toleration of the various regionalist parties. ?][? if weimar_coalition_heartland < 45: We remain in power for now, albeit unpopular. However, there is a risk that the conservative establishment may call for a <i>Commonwealth intervention</i> against our government. The Unity parties have amended state Assembly rules to require an absolute majority to elect a new Minister-President, enabling [+ heartland_leader +] to continue ruling as a caretaker government indefinitely. An attempt to repeal the change is unexpectedly blocked by the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, effectively making them a de facto tolerator of [+ heartland_leader +]. ?] 

[? if far_right_coalition_heartland + unionist_r_heartland >= 50: Furthermore, the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> has engaged in delicate negotiations with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> over their potential entry into state government. However, despite being an enticing offer, it remains unlikely they would enter without also securing federal participation, as well as control over the Minister-President’s office and the Heartland police—demands the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> will never accept. ?]

[? if heartland_leader != "Bristol": [+ heartland_leader +] is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland. ?]

