@give_up_prussia
title: Voluntarily transfer the Minister-President position to the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?], to foster good will between our parties.
subtitle: Bristol would need to resign.
on-arrival: coalition_dissent = 0; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick"; heartland_leader = "Askew" if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"; unionist_relation += 15; ddp_relation += 5; gold_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; gold_left += 2; ddp_left += 1; ddp_cohesion += 1; lvp_left += 2; reformist_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 5; burgher_marcher -= 4; landed_marcher -= 2; braun_resign = 1

We no longer control the government of Heartland. Hopefully, this move will pay off with a more friendly [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?], who are pleasantly surprised by our unexpected decision.

The Minister-President position is transferred to the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?]'s [+ heartland_leader +].

