@bourgeois_coalition_kvp_prussia
title: Refuse to form a government, so that a Propertied Bloc may be formed.
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] + Others[? if kvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CPP**</span>?] ([+ bourgeois_coalition_heartland +]%)
subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others**[? if kvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CPP**</span>?] ([+ bourgeois_coalition_heartland +]%)
